{"version":1,"content":"<p>無咁大個頭就唔好戴咁大頂帽，偏偏有啲人自以為是，亂咁借錢去投資，結果一鋪清袋，搞到走投無路。</p><p>AV業界資深人士神仙乙表示，唔少AV故事都同欠債有關，女主角因各種原因欠下巨款，無力償還，只好出賣身體，最後淪為債主們嘅洩慾工具！</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:19:46.264317+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:57.201748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:57.201748+00:00","content_hash":"c88e30df3386f30c9455a2175cd91445a54332a99e636cb8b8fbeefada5d4e7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}